# TizenPSX

PlayStation 1 emulation for Samsung Tizen TVs, powered by PCSX ReARMed.

## Coming soon

TizenPSX is an experimental native TV port currently in development and device testing.

This repository is a placeholder. Source code, installation instructions and release packages will be added when ready.

An independent community project; not affiliated with Samsung, Sony or the PCSX ReARMed team.
